<title>HONG KONG: Tsang sees pressure on labour, land resources.</title>
<headline>Tsang sees pressure on labour, land resources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong expects to see pressure on labour and land resources in the year ahead, which underlines the need for sound and prudent fiscal policies, Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said in his 1997/98 budget speech on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6352</p>
</text>
